*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0042
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 294
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0042.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PEN0042C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=ACTIVE S=SUSPENDED C=COLLECTIONS
    05 ACCT-STAT-CD       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 ACCT-SUSPENDED VALUE 'S'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STAT-CD=" ACCT-STAT-CD
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 3
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION - LIMIT 3 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 4 AND DAYS-LATE > 30
        SET ACCT-SUSPENDED TO TRUE
        ADD 50 TO LATE-FEE
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF DAYS-LATE > 72
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF DAYS-LATE > 90
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
    END-IF.
